u}$ decay influence these branching fractions. We employ a standard $U_1$ leptoquark model, analyzing the relevant effective Hamiltonian and associated Lagrangian. By computing the relevant hadronic matrix elements and utilizing $ ar{\Lambda}_b 	o p 	au  ar{
u}$ decay width, we derive the branching fractions for the processes $ ar{\Lambda}_b 	o p 	au  ar{
u}$ and $ ar{\Lambda}_b 	o p J/\psi K^- 	au  ar{
